            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SWEETIRIS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I altered the recipe slightly by mixing 1/2 the bread, tomato, onion, spices &amp; wine with the fish/shrimp mixture. Then I stuffed the squid. Baked it covered with the other 1/2 that was processed. It turned out excellent... A big hit in our house... You should try it - it gives the stuffing more flavour...",
